- actor(a_default, "Default", [...] ): Assigns all nodes to a single generic participant, omitting the source-specified responsibility of the "Customer" for action(n2, "Customer submits the RFQ").
- converge(c1), precedence(n8, c1), precedence(n9, c1), action(n10, "End process"): Implements a mandatory synchronization join and trailing actions, contradicting the source's explicit termination condition that "The process ends when the Goods are sent or when the Invoice is sent."